The remainder of this paper is organized as follows. Section~\ref{sec:back} provides the necessary background on agentic AI systems and the technical foundations relevant to our work. Section~\ref{sec:setup} details the methodology adopted for our analysis, including the threat modeling process and the rationale behind key design decisions. Section~\ref{sec:evaluation} presents our experimental findings and discusses the observed vulnerabilities. In Section~\ref{sec:related}, we review related work, contextualizing our contributions within the existing literature. Section~\ref{sec:ethic} addresses the broader ethical implications of this research, particularly the real-world risks associated with the discovered vulnerabilities. Finally, we draw our conclusions in Section~\ref{sec:concl}.

