In the first synthetic application we evaluate the sensitivity of each LLM to \texttt{direct prompt injection}. The architecture of the agent is simple and id depicted in figure~\ref{fig:scenario1}. The most important tool is named \texttt{run\_command} and allows the agent to perform commands to a non-interactive bash terminal through python libraries like \texttt{os} or \texttt{subprocess}. 

