    \item This approach generalizes the one-dimensional midpoint strategy to higher dimensions
    \item Lean's dependent types ensure we only access valid components of the vectors
\end{itemize}
This coordinate-wise approach is a powerful technique for extending one-dimensional results to multi-dimensional settings while maintaining rigorous proofs.
\end{leanfeature}

