earning techniques enable attackers to bypass traditional detection mechanisms by manipulating AI models for intrusion and anomaly detection. Additionally, cybercriminals leverage AI to automate reconnaissance, exploit development, and phishing campaigns, significantly increasing the scale and efficiency of attacks. These advancements underscore the necessity for AI-driven cybersecurity solutions that dynamically adapt to emerging threats and enhance threat intelligence capabilities.

