To evaluate the influence of fractal dimension on WMN performance, simulations were conducted in NS-3, measuring key metrics such as throughput, end-to-end delay, jitter, and PDR across a range of fractal dimensions. The simulation parameters are summarized in Table~\ref{tab:sim_params}. 


