\paragraph{Is money a long-term moat?} Companies and countries may care about having a competitive advantage by maintaining private/proprietary foundation models. We've seen that even drastic differences in compute investment in these models create only a modest difference in important capability measures. It is possible that in the long run, no entity can hope to keep a large advantage under the current paradigm simply by having more capital.


