\paragraph{Metrics}
We use nDCG@k(k=1,3,5) to evaluate retrieval performance. nDCG evaluates retrieval ranking quality by measuring both relevance and position of results with logarithmic position discount.
For evaluating QA performance, we calculate the log likelihood on benchmarks such as the BELEBELE and BoolQ datasets for accuracy measurement, and use the F1-score for SQuAD2.0. All experiments are conducted using the library\footnote{\scriptsize\url{https://github.com/EleutherAI/lm-evaluation-harness}} to ensure replicability.






