\subsection{Comparison with Fine-tuning MLLM}
\label{sec: appendix fine-tune mllm}
We conduct comparative experiments to evaluate the DIMT capabilities of MLLMs by directly applying MLLMs to the DIMT task and fine-tuning them specifically for this task.  
We fine-tune Vary-toy and Vary-base using LoRA \citep{DBLP:conf/iclr/HuSWALWWC22} with a $lora\_rank$ of 32, while keeping other settings consistent with the main experiment.  
The results are presented in Table~\ref{table: fine-tune mllm}.

As shown in the table, directly using MLLMs for the DIMT task yields very poor performance (line 1 and 4), with almost no translation capability on the political report domain.
