\section*{Impact Statement}

This paper presents work whose goal is to advance the field of Machine Learning, in particular for better measurement of model capabilities and safety relevant properties. Benchmark deprecation is discussed as a potential solution, but it may not be sufficient on its own to address the problems highlighted in this paper. 

