The gaps can lead to vulnerabilities and create security risks, e.g., unauthorized access, information leakage, and service unavailability \cite{intro6, intro11, intro12, intro13, intro14, intro15, intro16}. 
%
Effective security risk management is essential to mitigate these vulnerabilities and ensure compliance with industry standards.



