    (e) Socio-demographic correlates of the gender gap in abortion stance. Republican vote share, percentage of Black and Asian and percentage of uninsured individuals are statistically significant predictors of the gender gap in abortion attitudes. Asterisks indicate statistical significance ($\ast p < 0.05$, $\ast\ast p < 0.01$, $\ast\ast\ast p < 0.001$).}
