%     2 \log (2n) - \frac{1}{2} \log (\log (2n)\sqrt{\pi}) %=  \log(2n) +\{\log(2n)-\frac{1}{2} \log (\log (2n)) -\frac{1}{2}\log(\sqrt{\pi})\}
