\noindent\textbf{Gluing Process:} Let $\DDG{1}$ be a reduced directed graph and $H=H_1 \times \dots \times H_k $ be a finite nilpotent group. %, where $H_i$ is the Sylow $p_i$-subgroup of $H$. 
