\title{CLIP Won't Learn Object-Attribute Binding from Natural Data and Here is Why}

\author{Bijay Gurung$^{1,2}$ \hspace{0.5em}
David T.~Hoffmann\thanks{Shared last authorship. Correspondence to: gurungb@cs.uni-freiburg.de}$^{,1}$
